9VyzujgS2.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Set in Qin Dynasty during the warring states period in ancient China. Shin was a war orphan. He has a dream of becoming a great general Shin has a fateful encounter with young King Eisei. King Eisei aims to unify all of China.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":76349,\"title\":\"1911\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k93DWz849jCsHW7rIbeUAIxewpr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/io6lNWxoQB9YEjwhcT4CGDjyqhr.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"China's first President Sun Yat-Sen and military commander Huang Xing lead the revolutionary Wuchang Uprising in a bid to put an end to the reign of the Qing Dynasty.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":433694,\"title\":\"Sgt. Stubby: An American Hero\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rmpykGuvJznJw4iY4hpVVn5ZDdh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4pEbf7P2xlifhNmwAemcdAbomyZ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The true story of the most decorated dog in American military history - Sgt. Stubby - and the enduring bonds he forged with his brothers-in-arms in the trenches of World War I.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4435,\"title\":\"Aśoka\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ckFDMqLjhsYo2kH3X5auV1NnjPM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jyGiG4wcr0BHpqIXiep5MRCQ7Kz.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A young Prince Asoka works to perfect his skills in battle and also deals with family conflict. During a struggle with one of his step-brothers, his mother urges Asoka to escape to stay alive. While away, Asoka meets Kaurwaki and falls in love, but must use his skills as a warrior to protect her. A dangerous and heartbreaking web of conspiracy follows, which leads Asoka to embrace a Buddhist path.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":485296,\"title\":\"Redbad\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jmBXIR1nv1ueIBFBqKg60rLBzmQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aEmW8KkAgAe0JAhMAFm9EzKmseL.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the year of 754 AD, during a time of epic battles and bloodshed, the legend of the pagan warrior king, Rebad, is born, but so is a new weapon against his people: Christianity. Redbad must ultimately unite a Viking army powerful enough to defeat the seemingly invincible Franks.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"History\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":5058,\"title\":\"Aurélien\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/v8zaCXkFn9ZgcwyZkjhPSPVDOZZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"France, 1920s: An affluent ladies' man finds himself in love with a homely married woman.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"History\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":645995,\"title\":\"From Atatürk to Erdoğan: Building a Nation\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/l7JcMOPKIkL6Ij53NcbcNZr0fvW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cQnTtTIy3WttfG8NxIYnNVYYRlx.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Turkey's history has been shaped by two major political figures: Mustafa Kemal (1881-1934), known as Atatürk, the Father of the Turks, founder of the modern state, and the current president Recep Tayyıp Erdoğan, who apparently wants Turkey to regain the political and military pre-eminence it had as an empire under the Ottoman dynasty.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"History\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"LkOy4YzGaHE\",\"name\":\"Malazgirt 1071 | Fragman\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,